  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "rd01",
      "start": 4,
      "end": 31.881,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd01-01",
          "zh": "想象一个孩子。",
          "en": "Imagine a child.",
          "start": 5,
          "slot": 2.179,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 1.579,
            "en": 2.179
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd01-01.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 2.179
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-02",
          "zh": "别人把故事念给他听，他能说出发生了什么。",
          "en": "When someone reads a story aloud, he can tell us what happened.",
          "start": 7.979,
          "slot": 3.697,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.987,
            "en": 3.697
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd01-02.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.697
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-03",
          "zh": "轮到自己读，有些字却让他停下来。",
          "en": "When he reads it himself, some words stop him.",
          "start": 12.276,
          "slot": 3.618,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.01,
            "en": 3.618
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd01-03.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.618
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-04",
          "zh": "我们在学习阅读障碍的资料时，注意到这样的情况。",
          "en": "We noticed examples like this while learning about dyslexia.",
          "start": 16.594,
          "slot": 4.374,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 6.392,
            "en": 4.374
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd01-04.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.374
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-05",
          "zh": "有些孩子，认字、拼写很困难。",
          "en": "Some children find word reading and spelling difficult.",
          "start": 21.418,
          "slot": 3.478,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.433,
            "en": 3.478
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd01-05.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.478
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd01-06",
          "zh": "但单看这一点，还不能知道这个孩子能理解什么、能做什么。",
          "en": "That alone does not tell us everything they can understand or do.",
          "start": 25.646,
          "slot": 5.335,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 6.357,
            "en": 5.335
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd01-06",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd01-06.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 5.335
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd02",
      "start": 31.881,
      "end": 55.094,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd02-01",
          "zh": "所以，我们可以看看：这个孩子需要什么帮助？",
          "en": "So we can ask: what help does this child need?",
          "start": 32.581,
          "slot": 3.434,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.201,
            "en": 3.434
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd02-01.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.434
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd02-02",
          "zh": "如果今天是理解故事，可以听、看图，再聊一聊。",
          "en": "If today's goal is to understand a story, we can listen, look at pictures, and talk about it.",
          "start": 36.465,
          "slot": 6.479,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.485,
            "en": 6.479
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd02-02.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 6.479
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd02-03",
          "zh": "需要练认字时，就认真练认字，也给合适的帮助。",
          "en": "When the goal is word reading, we practise reading with suitable support.",
          "start": 43.394,
          "slot": 5.452,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.406,
            "en": 5.452
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd02-03.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 5.452
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd02-04",
          "zh": "每个孩子的情况不一样，我们要先了解他。",
          "en": "Each child is different. We need to get to know the child in front of us.",
          "start": 49.496,
          "slot": 4.698,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.869,
            "en": 4.698
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd02-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd02-04.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.698
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd03",
      "start": 55.094,
      "end": 80.848,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd03-01",
          "zh": "这启发我们想到中英文学习。",
          "en": "This led us to think about learning Chinese and English.",
          "start": 55.794,
          "slot": 3.792,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.369,
            "en": 3.792
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd03-01.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.792
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-02",
          "zh": "比如，一个孩子能听懂中文，却还不认识很多汉字。",
          "en": "One child may understand spoken Chinese but know only a few Chinese characters.",
          "start": 60.136,
          "slot": 4.672,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 6.656,
            "en": 4.672
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd03-02.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.672
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-03",
          "zh": "另一个孩子读中文比较顺，讲英文时却需要帮助。",
          "en": "Another may read Chinese more easily but need help speaking English.",
          "start": 65.258,
          "slot": 4.411,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 5.289,
            "en": 4.411
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd03-03.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.411
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-04",
          "zh": "这些情况和阅读障碍有不同的原因。",
          "en": "These difficulties have different causes from dyslexia.",
          "start": 70.319,
          "slot": 3.22,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.256,
            "en": 3.22
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd03-04.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.22
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd03-05",
          "zh": "它们提醒我们一个相似的问题：哪一步难？还能从哪里开始？",
          "en": "They invite a similar teaching question: which step is difficult, and where else can we begin?",
          "start": 74.139,
          "slot": 5.809,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 7.987,
            "en": 5.809
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd03-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd03-05.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 5.809
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd04",
      "start": 80.848,
      "end": 107.718,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd04-01",
          "zh": "我们来设想两个孩子。",
          "en": "Let's imagine two children.",
          "start": 81.548,
          "slot": 2.374,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 3.97,
            "en": 2.374
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd04-01.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 2.374
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-02",
          "zh": "Jacob 用中文讲故事比较顺，Mary 用英文讲比较顺。",
          "en": "Jacob tells stories more easily in Chinese. Mary tells them more easily in English.",
          "start": 84.372,
          "slot": 6.301,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 6.78,
            "en": 6.301
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd04-02.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 6.301
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-03",
          "zh": "学中文时，Jacob 可以帮 Mary；学英文时，Mary 可以帮 Jacob。",
          "en": "Jacob can help Mary with Chinese, and Mary can help Jacob with English.",
          "start": 91.123,
          "slot": 4.818,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 7.248,
            "en": 4.818
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd04-03.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 4.818
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-04",
          "zh": "这就是“互惠”：我有能帮你的地方，你也有能帮我的地方。",
          "en": "That is reciprocity: I have something that can help you, and you have something that can help me.",
          "start": 96.791,
          "slot": 6.712,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 7.126,
            "en": 6.712
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd04-04.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 6.712
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd04-05",
          "zh": "两个人都教，也都学。",
          "en": "Both children teach, and both learn.",
          "start": 104.053,
          "slot": 2.765,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 2.757,
            "en": 2.765
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd04-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd04-05.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 2.765
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rd05",
      "start": 107.718,
      "end": 129.776,
      "chunks": [
        {
          "id": "rd05-01",
          "zh": "可是，一开始话还说不通，怎么办？",
          "en": "What if they cannot yet explain everything to each other?",
          "start": 108.418,
          "slot": 3.154,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.628,
            "en": 3.154
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-01",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd05-01.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.154
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-02",
          "zh": "我们想到画画。",
          "en": "We thought of drawing.",
          "start": 112.422,
          "slot": 1.951,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 2.053,
            "en": 1.951
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-02",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd05-02.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 1.951
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-03",
          "zh": "两个人可以先画同一个故事，看同一张图。",
          "en": "They can draw the same story and look at the same picture.",
          "start": 114.823,
          "slot": 3.42,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.363,
            "en": 3.42
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-03",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd05-03.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.42
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-04",
          "zh": "图画让他们有一件可以一起看、一起说的事。",
          "en": "Now they have something to look at and talk about together.",
          "start": 118.693,
          "slot": 3.431,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 4.878,
            "en": 3.431
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-04",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd05-04.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.431
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-05",
          "zh": "这是他们共同的渠道。",
          "en": "Drawing is a channel they share.",
          "start": 122.674,
          "slot": 2.13,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 2.371,
            "en": 2.13
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-05",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd05-05.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 2.13
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "rd05-06",
          "zh": "看图之后，也要问问对方：你想表达的是这个意思吗？",
          "en": "They still need to ask each other: is this what you meant?",
          "start": 125.404,
          "slot": 3.472,
          "spoken": {
            "zh": 6.431,
            "en": 3.472
          },
          "tracks": {
            "en": [
              {
                "id": "rd05-06",
                "file": "audio/reciprocal-doors/en/rd05-06.wav",
                "lang": "en",
                "demo": false,
                "offset": 0,
                "seconds": 3.472
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
